{
  "version": 1,
  "description": "Mutants for the CI policy cases that R0b-3 added or changed and for the cases its adversarial check added (v8-arch-gyo2-r0b3-closeout). A mutant is killed only when the named case fails. Run from the repository root with cmake on PATH: python3 -B tests/common/mutation/run_mutations.py --build-dir <any existing directory> --catalog tests/common/ci/r0b3_mutations.json (no target is built; remove __pycache__ under tests/common/ci and build/ first).",
